%description:

The D2D link budget, against the closed form.

A D2D transmission takes a path of its own through the channel model:
D2dChannelModel builds a UE-to-UE link (d2dLink), evaluates it with the
D2D transmit power rather than the power the UE uses towards its base
station, applies the UE's antenna gain at both ends, and decides the
reception at the receiving UE (getSINR_D2D). None of it was graded --
LinkBudget covers the downlink, InterferenceDeltaUl the uplink.

The scenario is one D2D pair served by one gNB, with the flow started in
D2D mode, fixed transmission parameters, D2D interference off and every
random ingredient off. The SINR of a D2D reception is then a sum of
configured constants and one path loss:

    SINR = d2dTxPower - PL(d) + 2 Gue - cableLoss - (thermalNoise + ueNoiseFigure)

TR 38.901 has no UE-to-UE link. The model evaluates one with its configured
scenario and heights, as a UMi link here, and that is graded. The distances
are kept below the breakpoint distance, where the UMi LOS formula does not
depend on the antenna heights beyond fixing the breakpoint itself: past it,
the answer would depend on which heights a UE-to-UE link ought to take,
which neither the specification nor this test decides. A tripwire asserts
that the sweep stays below it.

The SINR is read from rcvdSinrD2D, recorded at the receiving UE for every
D2D reception. With nothing varying, every reception at one distance has
to report the same value, and the value has to fall with distance.

%extraargs: -c D2dLinkBudget

%file: demo.xml
<config>
    <interface among='eNB* eNodeB* enb* *Enb* gNB* gNodeB* gnb* *Gnb* upf* *Upf* mecHost* pgw*' address='10.x.x.x' netmask='255.255.255.0'/>
    <interface hosts='*' address='192.168.x.x' netmask='255.255.255.0'/>
</config>

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[Config D2dLinkBudget]
network = simu5g.simulations.nr.networks.SingleCell_Standalone_D2D
sim-time-limit = 3s
**.routingRecorder.enabled = false
cmdenv-express-mode = true
cmdenv-status-frequency = 10000000s
seed-set = 0

output-scalar-file = results/${iterationvarsf}${repetition}.sca
output-vector-file = results/${iterationvarsf}${repetition}.vec
**.vector-recording = false
**.rcvdSinrD2D.result-recording-modes = mean,count,min,max

############### D2D: one pair, the flow started in D2D mode ##############
**.ue*[*].hasD2D = true
*.gnb.hasD2D = true
*.numUeCell = 0
*.numUeD2DTx = 1
*.numUeD2DRx = 1
*.ue*[*].servingNodeId = 0
*.ue*[*].nrServingNodeId = 1
*.ueD2D*[*].cellularNic.d2dInitialMode = true
**.amcMode = "D2D"
# Fixed transmission parameters: the CQI the pair transmits with is then not
# an output of the link it is graded on.
**.usePreconfiguredTxParams = true
**.d2dCqi = 7
**.gnb.cellularNic.phy.enableD2DCqiReporting = false

############### The sweep ##############
# All below the UMi breakpoint distance (120 m for these heights at 2 GHz).
**.d2dDistance = ${d = 10, 25, 50, 100}

############### Geometry ##############
*.gnb.mobility.initialX = 300m
*.gnb.mobility.initialY = 300m
*.gnb.mobility.initialZ = 10m
*.ueD2DTx[0].mobility.initialX = 290m
*.ueD2DTx[0].mobility.initialY = 350m
*.ueD2DTx[0].mobility.initialZ = 1.5m
*.ueD2DRx[0].mobility.initialX = 290m + ${d}m
*.ueD2DRx[0].mobility.initialY = 350m
*.ueD2DRx[0].mobility.initialZ = 1.5m
**.mobility.constraintAreaMinX = 0m
**.mobility.constraintAreaMinY = 0m
**.mobility.constraintAreaMinZ = 0m
**.mobility.constraintAreaMaxX = 1000m
**.mobility.constraintAreaMaxY = 1000m
**.mobility.constraintAreaMaxZ = 50m
**.mobility.initFromDisplayString = false

############### The channel: one path loss and nothing else ##############
**.scenario = "URBAN_MICROCELL"
**.nodebHeight = 10m
**.ueHeight = 1.5m
**.dynamicLos = false
**.fixedLos = true
**.fading = false
**.shadowing = false
**.d2dInterference = false
**.downlinkInterference = false
**.uplinkInterference = false
**.bgCellInterference = false
**.extCellInterference = false

############### The budget terms, stated rather than inherited ##############
*.carrierAggregation.numComponentCarriers = 1
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].carrierFrequency = 2GHz
*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].numBands = 6
**.numBands = 6
**.eNodeBTxPower = 40dBm
**.ueTxPower = 26dBm
**.d2dTxPower = 20dBm
**.antennGainEnB = 18dBi
**.antennaGainUe = 3dBi
**.cableLoss = 2dB
**.thermalNoise = -104.5dBm
**.ueNoiseFigure = 7dBm

############### Traffic: a CBR flow over the D2D link ##############
*.ueD2D*[0].numApps = 1
*.ueD2DTx[0].app[0].typename = "CbrSender"
*.ueD2DTx[0].app[0].packetSize = 100B
*.ueD2DTx[0].app[0].samplingTime = 0.01s
*.ueD2DTx[0].app[0].localPort = 3088
*.ueD2DTx[0].app[0].startTime = 0.1s
*.ueD2DTx[0].app[0].destAddress = "ueD2DRx[0]"
*.ueD2DTx[0].app[0].destPort = 1000
*.ueD2DRx[0].app[0].typename = "CbrReceiver"
*.ueD2DRx[0].app[0].localPort = 1000

*.configurator.config = xmldoc("./demo.xml")

%postrun-command: ../../physics_reference.py --grade results >verdict.txt

%contains: verdict.txt
graded=16 failures=0

%not-contains: verdict.txt
FAILED
